Package: igraphinshiny
Type: Package
Title: Use 'shiny' to Demo 'igraph'
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2025-12-22
Authors@R: person("Ming-Jer", "Lee", email = "mingjerli@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    shiny,
    igraph,
    readxl
Description: Provides an interactive 'shiny' web application for demonstrating
    'igraph' plotting functionality and graph theory concepts. Users can
    visualize various graph types including random graphs, lattices, trees,
    and scale-free networks. The application also computes and displays
    adjacency matrices and various centrality measures such as betweenness,
    closeness, and PageRank. Supports importing custom graphs from CSV and
    Excel files.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/mingjerli/igraphinshiny
BugReports: https://github.com/mingjerli/igraphinshiny/issues
LazyData: TRUE
